HdSzNpVeXbabwCm-w5-6LtSdGY1sYVBYXC-Kz0B0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMVxNvd_Px1IzCl8ZwKBRNqj0FmULDSNVvtj64yvAg7iQ&oe=6AE5F989"}, "display_name": "Wreckin' Raccoon", "keywords": ["sandbox", "cat", "chaotic", "sim", "playground"], "long_description": "**Full details at discord.gg/raccoonvr**\n\nDesigned for your chaos \u2014 tag #wreckinraccoon\n ```\n```                                                                                                                                                                                    \n\n\ud83e\udd9d **Be the raccoon your intrusive thoughts want you to be.** \n{1366963918774223}\n\n\nStep into the paws of a mischievous raccoon with a love for food and a knack for causing chaos.\n\n\ud83e\udd9d **\"I May be Trash but I'm Someone Else's Treasure\"** \n{24920749837553105}\n\n\nBecome the ultimate troublemaker as you sneak, scamper, and stir up chaos in a pitstop diner.\n\n\ud83e\udd9d **\"I Heard What You Said I Simply Chose Not to Listen\"**\n{1145281954424153}\nBreak plates, raid the kitchen, zipline from the roof or even fry your own poop. There\u2019s no limit to the chaos you can create. Bonus points if you make the chef rage quit.\n\n\ud83e\udd9d **\"I'm Sorry for Being Annoying - It Will Happen Again\"**\n{843032821806912}\nFrom exploding pop cans to food guns, use anything and everything in the diner to add to the mayhem.\n\n```\n```\n- For reporting bugs and in-game problems, please also reach out to us on Discord  **discord.gg/raccoonvr**\n\n- **Follow us on TikTok: @wreckinraccoon**\n", "short_description": "Wreak havoc. Steal snacks. Be The Chaos."}]}, "developer_name": "nDreams Compass", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ndreams.com/wreckin-raccoon-privacy-notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://ndreams.com/wreckin-raccoon-end-user-licensing-agreement", "publisher_name": "nDreams", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.wreckinraccoon.